            "body": "@calops, this is now possible on latest `main`. There is a more general `extmark_opts` available which can utilize `virt_text_pos = 'inline'` feature.\r\n\r\nAnd regarding using that to show colors: this is now possible with a new [`style = 'inline'`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/35e29f7d680cfeb496415cadadd8c1f68db759b9/lua/mini/hipatterns.lua#L504-L505).",
